Trouble in charge of hiring foreigners "I want to suppress the retirement of foreign employees" What are the effective measures to improve the retention rate?
Among the companies that hire and hire foreigners, there are many managers and hiring managers who are worried that even if they hire foreigners, they will stop immediately.In this column, I will explain from "what is the cause of retirement of foreign employees" to "what can be done to reduce the retirement rate of foreign employees" from the perspective of an administrative scrivener who is a visa professional.
, Has increased significantly. However, it seems that many companies have the image that even if they hire foreigners, they will quit immediately.Although it cannot be said unconditionally depending on the industry, it can be said that foreigners generally have a higher turnover rate than Japanese people in terms of statistics.
Looking at the turnover rate of Japan as a whole from the "Overview of the 30 Employment Trend Survey Results" by the Ministry of Health, Labor and Welfare, the turnover rate of Japanese working under the condition of "no fixed employment period" is 8.6% for men. The percentage of women is 12.4%, and the average of men and women is 10.1%.
On the other hand, according to a survey of the turnover rate of foreigners by the ministry, the turnover rate of foreign workers was 44.5% for all industries and all businesses ("Foreign Employment Status Report (June 18)". 16.2st of the month) ").Since the turnover rate in Japan in the same year was XNUMX% for all industries and all businesses, it can be said that the rate of retirement of foreign workers is relatively high.
The main reasons why foreigners retire are said to be as follows.
・ I can't utilize my expertise and skills in my work
Now, let's look at the points to reduce the turnover rate of foreigners, which is generally high, and increase the retention rate.
Many foreigners feel that the concept of the relationship between superiors and subordinates and the order of seniors and juniors, which is often seen in Japanese companies, is unique.In addition, in companies where the horizontal connection of synchronous hiring employees, which is born from the employment practice of new graduate recruitment, is a characteristic of human relations, Foreigners often find it difficult to get into the circle It will be.
In addition, if the instructions and contacts within the company are ambiguous, for many foreigners who expect culturally clear instructions, Dissatisfaction You will feel it.
It is useful to take this method, and I think it will contribute to improving the retention rate.
Even if you say a foreign country, there are various cultures and ways of thinking depending on the country or region, and the differences also affect how you perceive "work."
In Japan, I think that the idea of giving priority to work to some extent, taking it as a matter of course to contribute to the organization of the company, and allowing overtime and holiday work to some extent is deep-rooted.However, for foreigners who want to prioritize their families and spend time with their families, this Japanese way of thinking is difficult to understand, and I am strongly dissatisfied with being forced to work overtime in the middle.
like this Retirement due to cultural differences The following points are important to prevent.
・ If you need to work on holidays, adjust the work day.
・ Do not force attendance at social gatherings outside working hours
For Japanese companies, even if it is a global company, it is possible to contact them for business within the company.JapaneseIs often used.
Therefore, as follows Let's pay attention to the important points.Effect of suppressing retirementCan be expected.
