Can minors and students be allowed to apply for naturalization?
Since there are differences in the rules of adult age depending on the country, it is possible that depending on the law of the foreigner's home country, "even if it is an adult under Japanese law, it is not recognized as an adult under the law of the home country". ..Therefore, there may be cases where you cannot apply for naturalization in Japan.
1-2 What happens if the age of majority is different under the law of the home country?
