The building cleaning field, which cleans the inside of a building, is one of the industrial fields for which the status of residence for specific skills has been granted.
In this section, we will explain the necessary conditions, the content of the accepted tasks, and the required exams when hiring foreigners in the building cleaning field.
In the field of building cleaning of specific skills, the government willIt is assumed that 37 and 000 foreigners will be accepted.
The ratio of job openings to job openings reaches 2017 by the year 2.95, and there is concern that the building's health may deteriorate and users' health may be impaired if the labor shortage continues.
However, as this alone can not cope with the labor shortage, the status of residence of certain skills opened a window to new foreigners.
Specifically: Cleaning work to protect the hygienic environment, maintain aesthetics, ensure security and improve maintenance, and work to eliminate environmental pollutants present in buildings and maintain cleanliness
Therefore, 5 year is the upper limit that foreigners with status of residence for specific skills can work.
