If you intend to continue your stay after the current period of stay with your current status of residence, please contact us by the date of your period of stay. Period of stay renewal permission application procedure Must be done.
If your period of stay is 6 months or more, you can basically apply from 3 months before your period of stay expires.
If you do not renew or change your period of stay, foreigners will be illegally staying and will be subject to heavy penalties.
If your application for renewal is accepted by the expiration date of your period of stay, you will not be immediately illegally resident even if your period of stay expires before your permission is granted.
If the application is not dismissed by the expiration date of the period of stay during the application for permission to renew the period of stay, when the disposition is made or when the day when two months have passed from the expiration date of the period of stay ends. Until the earliest, you can continue to stay in Japan with your previous status of residence.
