"Technical intern training No. 1" is a status of residence granted to foreigners for the purpose of technical intern training in the first year of entry, and is a qualification for training in skills.
This time, I will explain about "Foreign Technical Intern Training No. 1" of technical intern training.
The content of the technical intern training system is to promote the acquisition, mastery, and mastery of skills that are difficult for foreign technical intern trainees to learn in their own country by concluding employment-related contracts with companies in Japan. ..
The period of stay of "Technical Intern Training No. 1" is one year or six months, and does not exceed one year designated by the Minister of Justice.
・ Three years by shifting to "Technical Intern Training No. 2"
