In other words, "I don't know the reason, but it is necessary as a system, so please become a guarantor."
However, the guarantor does not have much responsibility, and it is very different from the "guarantor of debt" that we think of as a guarantor, for example.
Looking at these alone, it seems that all the guarantors have to take over.
In fact, the guarantor must guarantee the above three costs and legal compliance before the permanent resident applicant can live in Japan after submission.
However, you are wondering what kind of responsibility the guarantor will take in the event of an actual incident.
First of all, from the conclusion The guarantor does not receive any legal penalty for the applicant .
Therefore, even if you do not fulfill your promise, you will not be held responsible.
Civil guarantors, including guarantors of debt, have the "shoulder" aspect of the guarantor taking on the debt on behalf of the creditor if the debtor fails to meet its obligations.
On the other hand, the guarantor of the permanent residence application is not legally liable and cannot make any such claims.
Of course, the Immigration Bureau of Japan (immigration) cannot issue a payment order to the guarantor.
In this way, the responsibility of the guarantor is limited to "moral responsibility", and there is almost no responsibility to the permanent resident applicant.
What kind of person can be a guarantor for permanent residence?
・ Japanese or foreigners who have already lived permanently
If the guarantor stays in Japan for a shorter period of time than the applicant for permanent residence, he / she may not be able to fulfill the contents of the guarantor, so is he / she eligible to stay in Japan longer than the applicant?
As for income, it is OK as long as you have a stable and regular income, so there is no limit on how much your annual income is, for example.
As mentioned above, there are some conditions for a guarantor, but all of them are naturally satisfied if you work diligently.
Therefore, if the permanent resident applicant is in financial difficulty or has any incident, he / she will not be penalized.
