Why is dirty water dreaming: in a glass, in a pond?
Dreamers are advised to interpret dreams in their entirety, and not just individual symbols in them.
If you see a small puddle, or dirty water in a glass - the troubles will be insignificant and will not particularly affect the course of events in your life. If you see a huge pond with muddy water, and even get into it - you should be afraid of major trouble.
If you dream that dirty water is splashed by the wind from the reservoir - such a dream can mean your unstable emotional state, you will be prone to mood swings in the near future, which will lead to your painful attitude towards other people. Perhaps you were a rather demanding person, who could tell the truth in person without indiscriminately.
If a young girl dreams of a storm at sea, she will have to endure a long time because of not established love relationships. The whole problem is that the blame for this situation will be the human rumor.
Now they just need this bitter experience in order to draw conclusions and continue not to make such mistakes. If young people dream of a sailboat that rocks on murky waves - their hope for a cloudless future will be overshadowed by the truth.
In the dream book of Freud, it is said that dirty water dreams as a symbol of the impermanence of man in love. This he causes resentment of others and blame his way of life.
If a girl dreams that she is walking along a dirty pool, she will empty tears. Do not get upset because of someone else's character and other people's problems.
If a lonely man dreams, how he turns into a kind of muddy and dirty river - his sexual energy in stagnation and his sexual organs suffer because of this. Now he needs to pay special attention to his health.
Analyzing all the details of sleep it is possible to determine with accuracy who is really exerting this harmful influence. If a person dreams that he is overwhelmed by suddenly dirty water - his troubles do not have a certain author, they are the result of negative actions of a person in the past.
If you dream of dirty water in a glass - troubles can pass you, if you finish your work on time and do not make small mistakes. Try to resolve all conflicts and settle them as quickly as possible.
Also, a dream about dirty water can indicate a deception that a person can undergo. Deceive his close friend, a friend, whom he so much expected.
• Enter into a puddle - to commit an act and then regret it;
If you dream that you have slapped clothes with dirty water, you will be overwhelmed by the gossip of envious people who simply will not let you live peacefully. Try to keep all the events of your life in secret, do not brag about your successes, let them stay with you.
