The benefits of intense physical activity are not so many:
Sport in preschool years can only be viewed from the perspective of the type of activity, and not the way to achieve stunning results. Professional and near-professional sport in the preschool years is a difficult test for the body and continuous harm for a growing person.
Sport in childhood should be an interesting, easy exercise. Only as a method of physical development, and then not the main one, it is necessary to constantly monitor the health of the child and, in case of any doubt, consult a doctor and, if necessary, stop classes.
Children from 6 years and older can be sent to winter sports. First of all, we are talking about skiing as the safest among other winter disciplines.
Sports loads, if we talk about serious systematic classes "on the result" are not useful and are contraindicated in children. As for the way to spend time, discipline the child, develop physically, moderate physical activity in the framework of a particular sport will be useful and interesting.
