What documents are needed for a holiday with a child abroad
In accordance with the Administrative Regulations of the Federal Migration Service from 16 March 2010, the entry of data on children in the passport of the parent is made only to confirm the relationship, and does not give the right to leave the Russian Federation and enter the Russian Federation without a separate passport.
If the child has a personal passport, he in any case receives a separate visa. There is no universal document package.
On a trip to Russia, the child will need the original birth certificate and health insurance policy. If the child is traveling with distant relatives, you need a power of attorney from the parents.
