Discharge from the eyes of a newborn: when you need to sound the alarm?
How to "unlock" the tear duct?
Is discharge from the eyes the norm?
Tears form in the lacrimal gland, which is located directly above the eye. The tear fluid cleans and lubricates the surface of the eye.
If the lacrimal canal is blocked, the fluid is unable to drain from the surface of the eye. Contamination causes severe lacrimation, and sticky secretions may form in the corners.
Before touching an area close to the child’s eyes, it is important to wash your hands with soap and warm water. It is recommended that you thoroughly rinse your hands with water to prevent soap from getting into your baby's eyes.
Your doctor may also recommend gently massaging a blocked lacrimal canal to help open it. Qualified professionals will show you how to do it safely.
massage twice a day: once in the morning and once in the evening;
Probing of the nasopharyngeal duct is a procedure that involves inserting a small probe into the lacrimal canal of an infant. Using tools that gradually increase in size, the doctor will be able to open the lacrimal canal.
Parents need to see a pediatrician or optometrist if lacrimation intensifies or other symptoms occur. Medical specialists will help diagnose the cause and rule out infections.
Dreams are sometimes exciting, but at the same time enjoyable. Also, dreams are awesome and cause negative emotions.
Fresh cucumbers in a dream - this is a good sign, after such a dream it is necessary to wait for the end of the period of anxieties and troubles. If you have been ill for a long time, your illness will recede, and you will be able to fully engage in all the things that have so long been planned.
Fresh green cucumbers dream of new beginnings and new discoveries. It is worth to look at all the details of the dream, and make a complete interpretation of the scenario:
It is also important to pay attention to the following interpretation of dreams:
• If you dream about picking fresh cucumbers from the garden, the result of your hard work will not be long in coming;
• If you dream about how someone robbed your garden bed, where green cucumbers grew - such a dream means that another person will take your merits.
Such a dream says that a person has ill-wishers who try in every way to hurt a person and simply simply to frustrate all his plans for the future.
If you dream about how someone else grows cucumbers in your garden - such a dream means that either someone will pozaritsya, for your personal happiness, or for your professional success. If you know the person in person - in reality you should not trust him and share with him the secret, most likely he will betray you.
Also, such a dream can mean that you in time would be occupied with your image, do self-improvement. You have long ceased to monitor yourself and your actions, but strangers do this and find in your actions a lot of unlawful.
If you dream of a large feast and the main dish on it will be fresh cucumbers - such a dream means that soon you will be pleased with the news, they will allow you to look at everything in your life differently. This is likely to be news from your distant relatives, or from close friends.
If a man dreams about how a woman feeds his cucumbers, he should immediately diversify his sex life. His energy is in stagnation, he is not in demand.
What is fresh cucumber dreaming about Esoteric Dream Book
If he dreams of how he eats fresh cucumbers, he will overcome all the intrigues of his enemies and remain in his own interests. If a man picks cucumbers in a dream, such a dream means that he will soon collect the fruits of his labors.
In the Astronomerian dream book such a dream means that a person will soon say goodbye to all troubles and all diseases. The hard period will be left behind, and only new achievements will await him.
In the Modern Dream Book it is said that if cucumbers are dreaming of men - this is for money, if women - for gifts. If you dream of cucumbers in the snow - you are waiting for gossip about secret love affairs and lovers.
If you dream that someone is trampling on your cucumbers - your desires and the most positive thoughts will in the literal sense of the owl be trampled. You will be very upset by this, but do not worry too much about this, soon everything will be fine, you just look at the attacker in a completely different light.
