This is not so! The animal cannot adequately assess its behavior in connection with irreversible physiological changes in the cerebral cortex.
The list of neurodegenerative changes:
If the pet previously knew the basic commands and willingly executed them, then with the "old dog syndrome" they are partially or completely forgotten. The once smart dog begins to defecate in the house, forget to ask, ignores the owner’s discontent.
Factors that cause neurodegenerative changes are associated with a low intake of oxygen and nutrients in the brain cells, as well as poor blood supply to organs and impaired functioning of the cardiovascular system. According to statistics, 30-70% of dogs that crossed the 8-year milestone have 1-2 signs of ACS.
Specific treatment for ACS has not been developed!
Ready-made feeds of premium and super-premium class containing antioxidants and fatty acids (Canine b / d, Hills Pet Nutrition) are recommended. They somewhat alleviate the symptoms, making the coexistence of man and dog bearable.
Knowing the diagnosis helps the owner understand his dog, makes him treat his quirks indulgently and help “old men and old women” adapt. SKD requires the owner's sympathy and participation, which will brighten up the last years of the dog in the human family.
What to look for when choosing a land plot
Is the site suitable for construction
It’s good to choose land on the principle: "I just like it there!" BUT!
In this article you will learn the criteria that you need to pay special attention to in such an important case.
What are you going to do on the land?
Please note that the entire land fund is divided into several purposes:
For settlements.
For the seas, rivers, lakes and other reservoirs.
For purchase, most often choose the first or second category. On agricultural land it is allowed to create country non-profit partnerships, to conduct subsidiary farming, to engage in gardening, to erect individual buildings.
It is especially difficult to process clay layers, so sand and peat are brought to such a site for loosening. Also find out the ratio of humus and organic nitrogen in the sample.
During the construction process, clay soil causes a lot of trouble. After rain, the clay loses its solid properties, swells and dries for a long time.
Now you know that the composition of the soil on your site affects the complexity and, accordingly, the cost of the buildings.
What are their plans for the future?
A farm with piglets or birds may be nearby, with sensitivity to harsh odors, such a neighborhood is not suitable for you. Land address
Pay attention to the location of the boundary and the fence. These concepts have different purposes.
For the sake of economy, they put a common fence in the middle of the border. But there can be two parallel fences, and between them there is an empty strip or path about a meter wide.
The big problems for a quiet stay are created by the incorrect location of the bathhouse, dog enclosure, courtyard toilet, compost and cesspool.
Compliance with at least these criteria when choosing a land plot in the future will save you from problems.
