Seeds: benefits and harms to your health. What more?
They have healing properties, so they are so useful for the human body. However, not everyone knows exactly how the seeds affect health and what harm they can still cause.
Sunflower seeds are a source of amino acids, vegetable fats and fat-soluble vitamins that lower cholesterol and aging processes. The composition of the seeds also includes:
Amino acids inhibit the absorption of cholesterol and slow down the aging process.
Sunflower seeds not only benefit, but also can harm the body. The product is not recommended to be abused in the presence of the following factors:
Clicking the seeds can destroy too sensitive enamel. In this case, the front teeth darken, and a gap is formed between them.
Therefore, they are not recommended for singers. Such a product is completely contraindicated in people with persistent edema of the limbs.
At the time of roasting, the product not only loses its nutritional properties, but also can harm the body. Unfortunately, many manufacturers ignore this indicator and continue to fry the seeds before selling.
