So that he did not even understand what it was she wanted, and not he himself decided. I look at the family albums of those years and see a very diligent young woman who has the perfect order, the child in lace is sitting in her arms, next to a quiet, slightly detached husband ... Cuttings with recipes from the journal "Lisa", magnets on the refrigerator, in the corner of the hula -chup.
