That is, we are changing, and in the relationship it would be necessary to change something. But for these changes, the eternal willingness of a good girl to do everything on the top five is not enough.
These are quite prosperous stories in generally well-off people. They all looked for something, lost something, something else they would find and reinterpret what they had lived through.
