From the way a child is born depends on his health
In the 21st century, medicine can allow a woman to choose how her child will be born: natural childbirth, cesarean section, stimulation with oxytocin and even childbirth in the water or accompanied by doula. The first three methods are directly related to the health of the child.
How does the way of birth affect future health?
Explain what exactly happens to the little person at the moment of passing through the birth canal. Knowing these mechanisms, you can make a conscious choice in favor of natural childbirth (after all, a woman does not always go for a cesarean section solely for medical reasons - often she is simply afraid to give birth or thinks that her figure will deteriorate).
Why did they write the book - to once again scare the mankind?
When such a child becomes an adult, his immune system begins to attack not antigens, but, for example, respond to gluten. Or to react to objectively harmless agents in the form of dermatitis.
The reverse side of stimulation with oxytocin
Today, oxytocin is often used with ease even when there is no obvious medical need for it. It is used not in the cases shown for this drug, but for stimulation of contractions.
In addition to direct transmission of microbes to the next generation on the maternal line (through the grandmother's pathways - to the mother, from the mother to the child ...), there is another micro-effect that occurs during childbirth. These more complex mechanisms are studying epigenetics.
From the point of view of epigenetics, not changes in this particular gene are considered, but changes over the genome that can trigger the gene expression in another scenario.
Referring to experts, the authors of the book suggest that while the child develops in the womb, certain of its genes are in the off state. Passage through the birth canal, stress and pressure can be the most important environmental factors that include the genes necessary for health.
Why did they write this book?
The use of antibiotics, modern nutrition and lifestyle, as well as an increase in the number of cesarean sections - all these factors contribute to reducing the number of bacteria. Under the most pessimistic scenario, "antibiotic winter" awaits us, when we will all become receptive not only to modern non-infectious diseases, but also to infectious diseases.
How to choose a swimsuit for full-sized photos.
Inspired by the beautiful advertising images of graceful nymphs emerging from the foam of the sea, the beauty that nature has awarded with magnificent forms, going on vacation, slowly, but confidently begin to grow a bunch of awkward complexes, the whole essence of which comes roughly to the following: for the bbw of beautiful, stylish and sexy swimsuits Do not sew!
The models are so interesting and vivid that they are not inferior in their originality to swimsuits of standard sizes. It turns out that the point is not at all that fashionable stylish swimsuits are not created for beauties with curvaceous shapes, the problem is of a different kind - even the most expensive branded beach outfit, selected without taking into account the features of the figure, will not look spectacular and emphasize your charms.
Inverted Triangle Girls with this type of figure have wide shoulders and rather big breasts, but the waist line is weakly expressed and the hips are usually narrow.
In girls with a physique of this type the decollete zone is very refined, the waist is thin, and the hips are wide enough that as a whole makes the figure graceful and at the same time appetizing. If a girl with this type of figure is inclined to fullness, then "under attack" falls the lower part.
Shoulders and hips visually seem to be equivalent in width, and the waist of these girls is weakly expressed. Girls with this type of figure, inclined to fullness, gain weight proportionally in all parts of the body.
And finally, we came to the most feminine type of figure - an hourglass. Even with a pair of three extra kilo ladies with such a physique look very sexy and feminine, which is achieved due to a thin pronounced waist and equivalent in the girth of the chest and thighs.
Problem areas - narrow shoulders, too wide hips and weak waist. Pay attention to the models of swimsuits, which balance the proportions - will make the shoulders wider, the hips slightly narrower, and the waist more slender.
To increase the volume of the shoulders and make them visually wider will help the bodices or top of the swimsuit with widely spaced straps. The swimwear swim dressesKiyonna
Alternative for a miniature upper part - a model with frills, flounces or other decor in the shoulder area. Monif C.One of the simplest and most effective techniques for modeling any type of figure is the use of contrasting colors and inserts.
For narrow thighs melting slip, shorts, retro models and meltings with an overestimated waist are good.
(note - about the techniques that will help to adjust the waist line, make it more elegant and slim read below)
Swimsuits with a scent on the waist. A single-piece version of a piece-swimsuit with a light edging in the decollete zone, for those who prefer quiet colors.
In the first photo above, a light light pattern makes the hips somewhat wider, wide straps and rims along the notch increase the volume of the shoulders; The diagonal smell from the shoulder to the waist makes the latter more slender and elegant. On the second photo, the dark bottom is the winning item for the holders of a figure A.
Balance proportions and simulate the silhouette will help piece pajamas with side inserts and color contrast. In the photo below, the horizontal lines in the chest area and hips increase the volume, vertical stripes around the waist - pull out the silhouette and slim.
Dark contrast inserts can be located only in the waist region.
Note that the modeling inserts need not be only dark tones. All focus in contrast.
