How to accelerate the metabolism in the body and lose weight at home
Often, in an effort to quickly throw off the hated kilograms, we limit our daily diet to such an extent that we do not cover even the level of basic metabolism. Our body, realizing that the "black days" have come, goes into the "energy saving" mode.
- There are several simple, but quite effective ways to "spur" the asleep exchange, to give the body the opportunity to fight with new forces with extra pounds. - prompts our constant expert, dietician Ludmila Denisenko .
Any physical activity, whether walking or cycling, swimming or dancing, spurs the burning of fat - and almost for an hour after it stops. The most preferred are the strength exercises that promote the growth of muscle tissue, because muscles require the expenditure of calories even in peace!
In addition, take hot baths (duration 5-10 min) and contrast showers, which also speed up the metabolism. 5.
Water is the matrix of life, the basis of metabolism. Lack of water can significantly slow down metabolism - because the main task of the liver in this case will restore the body's fluid reserves, and not burn fat.
Especially now, in the spring. Sunlight and fresh air increase human activity, accelerate metabolism and stabilize and activate protective forces.
For example, juniper essential oil helps relieve muscle pain, dilates blood vessels, thereby improving blood circulation and accelerating metabolism. It can be added to the massage cream or simply to inhale the smell.
Stress releases fatty acids that are redistributed through the circulatory system and stored in fat. Learn to relax after a hard day - the same hot bath, self-massage or yoga will help in this.
Often have sex! Sex accelerates the metabolism, because with orgasm blood is intensely saturated with oxygen, the nutrition of tissues improves and, consequently, the metabolism is accelerated.
According to many researchers, it is this hormone that is responsible not only for the metabolic rate in the body, but also for fundamental decisions about whether to burn fat at the moment or to store it. The best products with high content of omega-3 fatty acids are fatty fish, flaxseed and oil from it, broccoli, beans, Chinese cabbage, cauliflower and walnuts.
Also speeds up metabolism. As the results of studies of British dieticians testify, the sufferers from excess weight, which increased the daily intake of calcium to 1200-1300 mg, dumped weight twice as fast as those to whom calcium was delivered within the usual daily rate.
Coffee, green teacontaining caffeine. They also accelerate the metabolism by 10-16 percent, facilitating the release of fatty acids from fat tissues.
