Let's highlight several important points that characterize this year:
Here we are talking not only about the outstanding issues and the unresolved difficulties of 2017, but also about what happened much earlier and was almost forgotten. Information that has been hiding for a long time can become public, this will prevent the implementation of new plans.
Unpleasant lessons in the 2018 year will be very much. Someone, of course, will try to avoid them, but later regret it.
By the beginning of winter, it is desirable if not to solve all financial issues and pay off debts, then at least draw up a plan of action, which you will adhere to by the end of the year. Unreasonable expenses, spontaneous purchases should be minimized.
December - it's time to figure out which plans should be implemented first, and for which it is better not to undertake. Build plans seriously and thoughtfully, listen to intuition tips, and on New Year's Eve you will not only make wishes, but also know exactly what you should do to make them come true.
Taurus: This year is the way from the confused and incomprehensible to the clear and simple. You have to get a lot of contradictory and ambiguous information, understand and accept something that previously seemed too complicated.
Cancer: It is better not to count on particularly easy successes. But if you are willing to work hard and deserve a reward, you can not doubt that it will be very generous.
Virgo: A year is associated with a reassessment of values and a change in habits. It will be necessary to reconcile with the fact that not all circumstances can be influenced, but some can benefit.
Scorpio: Use the first half of the year to, first, gain strength, and secondly - to acquire useful skills, they will soon come in handy. The easy months will be replaced by rather tense ones, but the difficulties will not frighten you, and you will hardly complain about life.
Capricorn: A difficult but fruitful year. You will achieve a lot if you decide on the goals and methods of achieving them in time.
Fish: Sometimes it will be difficult, but nevertheless the influence of positive tendencies will prevail during this year. Your task is not to miss your chance, try to get the most out of any circumstances.
