In terms of honesty, Virgo is one of the most controversial characters about which one can say “50 / 50”. Either she will tell you too much and too honestly that you will feel uneasy from her frankness, or she will be completely closed, even with the closest and closest relatives.
According to Cancer, when you love and appreciate a person, you should be sincere and open. Any lie destroys friendship or relationships - that is why Cancer prefers the truth.
Aries is one of the most honest signs, which does not hide anything from anyone. It may sound too straightforward and even tactless, but Aries will prefer to tell you the truth (no matter how unpleasant and shocking it can be).
