The payment of this benefit is carried out at the expense of the Federal Fund of State Insurance. In the case of the birth of twins or triplets, they are paid respectively in double or triple sizes.
The main conditions for obtaining such a benefit are the presence of Russian citizenship. If a child was born in Russia, but his parents are foreigners or stateless, they will not be able to receive money.
You can apply for a one-time benefit for six months after the birth of your child. During this period, there is really a certificate issued to parents in the hospital.
