The quarrels are no longer so dramatic, because both know that the quarrel is ending, and the relationship needs to continue. If both do everything to develop patience, wisdom will come to them in the course of time.
This is the first stage of true love, because before this love was not yet. Partners begin to understand their responsibilities, thinking not about what another partner should do to him, but about what he can do and give to his beloved.
They trust each other as their closest friends. The stage of friendship opens the way to true love.
