The first signs of pregnancy before the delay of menstruation
But besides this, there are a number of signs by which a woman can determine that the birth of a new life occurs in her body.
There is weakness, loss of strength and drowsiness, regardless of the duration of a night's sleep. And sleep becomes restless.
In the first days there is a feeling of inconvenience from wearing a bra, the breasts begin to "pour".
Increased salivation. In the body of a pregnant woman, a strong irritation of the salivary center occurs, resulting in weight loss of up to 3 kg per week.
These symptoms are the result of a general rebuilding of the body and increased production of hormone progesterone, suppressing the psyche. But with the increase in the gestation period, the level of estrogen that exerts a stimulating effect on the psyche increases.
Basal temperature in pregnant women, sharply decreases from the second half of the menstrual cycle. Fluctuations in the basal temperature are due to a decrease in the level of progesterone and the release of estrogen at the time of pregnancy.
This is due to the increased concentration of hydrogen ions during pregnancy, protecting the woman's vagina from the penetration of pathogens. Because in this environment there is a rapid reproduction of candida yeast fungi that cause thrush.
After all, a multifaceted process takes place in order to preserve and adapt the life of a tiny embryo to further development. His set of chromosomes from the father is alien to the mother's body, and to prevent rejection, the woman's immunity decreases.
A characteristic sign of pregnancy. There are unpleasant sensations in the region of the sacrum and pelvic region.
The increased production of progesterone causes a delay in salts and fluid in the body and swelling of the extremities may appear.
Changes in the function of the urinary system is the result of hormonal changes, which is associated with a rush of blood in the pelvic organs.
Lowering blood pressure.
