In addition, fish oil prevents the appearance of early gray hair, as it regulates the production of a natural pigment - melanin.
If the skin is very dry, taking fish oil will help relieve unpleasant sensations. The skin will become tender, elastic, will get an even texture and a pleasant healthy color.
