Myths that the bandage prevents the appearance of stretch marks, doctors refute. The process of formation of striae is associated not only with the tension of the skin, but more with hormonal changes.
In an ideal adaptation, a woman should not feel his presence. Consider when choosing the size of the bandage, that the belly will still increase.
To properly wear a bandage, follow these recommendations:
Lie for a while, so that the muscles relax, the child takes a comfortable position. This will relax the bladder and escape the feeling of heaviness.
Wear a supporting element no longer than three hours. Then you need to take a break for half an hour.
If the baby behaves in the abdomen is too restless, the bandage should be removed. To reapply use no earlier than half an hour.
If you decide to use a bandage during pregnancy, and the doctor does not have prohibitory arguments, do not listen to negative reviews.
