Dreams in which people are pleasant moments - are remembered for a long time. It can be meetings with old friends, with lovers.
If the girl dreams, how honey flows down his hands - Do not stop halfway to the cherished goal. The girl, most likely, has grandiose plans for the near future, but for the time being she has only a weak idea of how to implement them.
If the girl dreams, how she collects honey on the table - such a dream means missed opportunities in the past, which she will now try to realize with all her might. If such a dream is repeated again and again - it is worth considering whether the person is on the right track, it might be better to change the tactics and strategy of behavior, for the quick achievement of the goal.
If you dream that Honey was presented to you - remember who brought you such a hotel. This person sincerely wishes you prosperity and good luck, you can not worry that your communication with him will end in a negative, in fact, you will soon receive remarkable news from him.
If you dream, how children eat honey - you will have to take care of the health of others. They now need your care and love like never before.
If you dream, how someone left a barrel of honey on your doorstep - remember if there is a note. If there is no note - you should guess who it could be.
It is worth remembering if it was delicious honey?
If you dream about how you eat honey, candied sugar - material prosperity for you is more important, than spiritual intimacy and love. Such a dream can also indicate a long-standing relationship that has become obsolete, and you still can not accept it.
In the esoteric dream book it is said that honey dreams of a happy and sweet life, do not look for enemies, where they really do not exist, from this you only suffer and can not ease your agony. You should pay more attention to others and not look for enemies in them.
If you dream that you eat honey together with the household, and it seems bitter to you - an important conversation with them awaits you, which is simply unavoidable, this conversation can lead you into frustrated feelings. In the end, you will discover many new and good things.
• Strained honey dreams to a joyful meeting;
• Honey bought on the market - fortunately in love.
If you dream a barrel of honey from which oozes honey - this dream says that you can lose your head in the flow of events. Try to know the measure in everything and do not try to appear better than you really are, especially in the eyes of strangers.
