The causes of white plaque in the language of an adult
If the film is difficult to remove and remains even after the most thorough cleaning, it can talk about this or that disease of the internal organs. For a more accurate identification of the cause, it is necessary to pay attention to the color of the film, its thickness, location, shape and dimensions.
The location of the plaque allows us to determine quite accurately the organ that needs treatment:
middle part : the left edge is projected liver, to the right pancreas, in the middle stomach. Base : edges correspond kidneys, area in the middle intestines.
