This helps not only identify character by date of birth, but also reveal the secrets of fate. A person born in a particular year should not have these or those qualities, but often the totem can tell what and how to do, helps to find a destination.
And today the editors "So simple!" tell you under the sign of which animal You were born and what purpose is said about this.
This table will help you determine what kind of totemic animal you have. An important clarification: in this system each totem confronts its own antitem - these are temptations that a person can wait on the way, and then, yielding to something, a person will get out of his way.
The antitude of the Mongoose is stupidity, helplessness and lies. Walking along this path will only give rise to darkness.
Wolves are travelers, they are looking for adventure and can not stay in one place. The totem gives a person an extraordinary strength of mind and the ability to survive in extreme conditions.
Anti-totem of the Stork is manifested in disregard for the home and for their children.
These are people who can not live alone, they must have their own clan. Spider's totem assumes sluggishness and harmony, but also sensitivity and tremendous creativity.
Antitotem - nervousness and hysteria. Such people easily fall under the influence of others.
Unpredictable nature and extraordinary destiny - that's what you can say about Crows. They love to live solely on their own, at their pleasure, without commanding others, but also not submitting to anyone.
The antitotem of the Rooster is infantilism and sweetness. Such people are very lazy, cowardly and helpless.
The tour is an idealist by nature, he is soft and pliable, he has a vulnerable soul. But behind this vulnerability is hidden the power and desire to protect their loved ones to the last drop of blood.
Antithets hedgehog suggests cowardice, lies and dirty tricks. It manifests when a person becomes illegible in connections.
The elephant's antitotem is stunted, fussy, talkative and deceitful people. They are cowardly and cause all the big harm in a stealth.
This is the smith of his happiness: honest, brave and strong. These people are active, love sports and strive for athletic build.
The antithesis of Cygnus is greed and concentration on material goods.
They are quite unpredictable: they can manifest themselves abruptly and suddenly. Of them, good leaders turn out, but often the Lynx find fault with other people for no reason.
In the year of the Fox, people are born with very mysterious and strange destinies, often uneasy. They are clever, clever and cunning people.
They are always ready to rebuff the enemy, they want to be a leader and lead others. Vepras are very changeable: when they have a goal, they go to it with all perseverance, but as soon as it is achieved, Vepr will fall into apathy.
And, as it turned out, find your totem. We hope that this unusual horoscope helped you to reveal the secrets of your destiny and to understand yourself a little.
