The eyes are the mirror of the soul, but the language is an indicator of internal health, because with almost one hundred percent accuracy can tell about the condition of internal organs, as well as the origin and stage of development of certain diseases. Doctors often warn: "You can feel and then suddenly lose strength.
will tell you why it is necessary to pay attention to the shape, color and plaque in the language, as well as what possible problems are evidenced by those or other changes in the organ of taste and speech. We calculate the "enemy" by language!
Language has long been considered an indicator of the health of internal organs and systems, and sometimes its characteristic changes appear much earlier than other signs of the disease. This was well known in the East, and it was there that introduced this seemingly unusual but very effective method of early detection of pathologies - diagnostics of diseases by language.
Food, drinks, medicines, tobacco are able to change the color of the plaque, introducing inaccuracy in the diagnosis process. During the examination, you need to open your mouth wide, stick out your tongue, but do not strain it, as it distorts its shape and color.
Cyanotic shade upper and lower surfaces of the tongue will tell you about cardiovascular failure long before the appearance of gravity in the heart. Such coloring of the tongue can indicate a violation of blood circulation and cardiopulmonary insufficiency.
Pale coloration of the lower part of the tongue can indicate the pathology of the gallbladder and liver. Very pale tongue - a true companion of anemia and severe exhaustion of the body.
Hypertrophy and redness the papillae of the right half of the tongue speaks of the pathology of the kidneys, the left one - about possible diseases of the spleen, hypertrophy at the tip of the tongue and screams about the diseases of the pelvic organs, and the enlargement of the papillae and reddening of the middle and lateral surfaces of the tongue can indicate lung pathology.
Curvature of the central line language indicates problems with the vertebral column: the curvature at the root of the tongue speaks about the same problem in the lumbar spine, the curvature in the center indicates problems in the thoracic region, and the tip contortion about possible cervical osteochondrosis. Also, the curvature or deflection of the central line of the tongue can occur with an acute stroke, which is important for early diagnosis.
The healers of China and Tibet literally "read" the human language, thereby obtaining accurate information about the state of internal organs without intricate equipment and tests, which are equipped with modern doctors. Do not neglect this simple and accessible for every method of diagnosis, which is not difficult to do on your own, for example, in the morning while brushing your teeth.
Symptoms of emotional burnout are present in many parents.
If you are at home with a year-old child and just as happy to communicate with him, then these relationships can not be called equal. You are solely responsible for it, this is vertical communication.
Parent's work is round-the-clock, without holidays and days off. Often even on vacation, when the baby is left with a grandmother or nanny, mom and dad are experiencing, can not completely relax, the tension is only growing.
Growing children, weather, there is no help from relatives, the child is often sick, there is not enough money and so on. Problems overlap one another, and at some point the psyche simply ceases to cope with chronic overstrain.
If the grandmothers are far away, and the money for a nanny is not enough, my mother is actually cut off from any social ties. She may not have time to go to the toilet elementary or eat a bowl of hot soup.
If the child is naughty, refuses to do something, we do not get into this trance. We find a way to distract him, we offer some games, we can invent a fairy tale on the go.
It turns out a vicious circle - the less energy, the less power to react adequately to the difficulties and the worse the children behave, and this leads to new losses of power.
Like any other disease, the syndrome of emotional burnout is easier to prevent than cure. This is a painful state of the nervous system, not a fantasy, not a fictitious or wrong attitude to life.
Rest and communication "horizontally" - spouses with each other, with friends, with colleagues.
Change your life every day for a little bit.
