In this case, this is a continuation of the day's and not only the experiences, and does not foretell any more or less significant changes in the state of health. Often such dreams are dreamed of by those who with impatience and anxiety await monthly departures of the body.
Monthly you can see and not their own, and started with another woman - this dream does not portend the bad girl herself, but can talk about the problems of a dreamed friend or relative. It can also warn about the attitude of this woman, about her thoughts or desires.
Apparently, she treats you more confidentially than she wants to show. To see someone's monthly blood or underwear, her clothes soiled in her home - perhaps someone wants to get into confidence with their own selfish goals.
In general, all the menstrual blood of strangers or strangers, causing dislike or fear in a dream, warns of the troubles that detractors in the sphere of personal relationships can cause. It can be a rival who wants to beat off a loved one and for this purpose spreading false rumors, and maybe even the wrong actions of the girl herself, which frightens a young man he likes by some actions.
Menstrual blood, a dream of a man, indicates his negative attitude towards a particular girl or about mistrust of women in general. A man who sees a girl in a dream, her underwear or blood on the bed, rather subconsciously feels a loss of respect for her.
A girl who has seen in her dreams that her blood is bleeding too much, she can not stop her and is afraid of it, she is most likely afraid of her femininity or awakening feelings, subconsciously afraid of marriage, growing up, changing her status. It can also be a warning that the beginning romance will not be long.
He often has a completely physiological explanation, since menstruation is an important part of a woman's life. Nothing special is that the girls think about it, and from time to time they see in a dream.
