What you can not treat your pet
During training, this is a great incentive and reward for success, in stressful situations, your favorite treat helps to cheer and relax the pet.
However, the unreasonable feeding of treats can harm the health of a four-legged friend. Many dogs and cats are very fond of chocolates, sweets, pastries, as well as fried, smoked meat dishes.
chocolate (detrimental to the functioning of the circulatory system, and also causes problems with the intestines);
citrus (can cause allergies; dogs and cats, as a rule, do not like them themselves, however some eat with appetite);
baked goods (upsets the metabolism, causes bloating, flatulence and other digestive problems; yeast dough can cause poisoning);
Be sure to remember if the owner gives the pet dry or canned branded feed, in no case can cats be fed dog food, and dogs, respectively, cat food.
The fact is that cats and dogs belong to different families of animals and, although they have a very similar body structure, they differ significantly in the needs of the consumed substances.
If a pet enjoys such goodies and feels good - let him eat for health, the main thing is not to overdo it. If milk is not digested properly, it must be completely excluded from the diet.
Goodies that are eaten right away - cookies, drops, rolls etc. well suited for promotion in training and walking.
And, of course, any goodies are a manifestation of the owner’s love and care.
meat cubes, plates (beef, poultry are well suited for the manufacture of this treat; they are given raw or boiled);
When making treats, it is important to consider the serving size. It should correspond to the size of the dog or cat - the pet should be comfortable eating treats, there should be no threat to choke.
Firstly, excessive consumption of vitamins, microelements, macrocells and other beneficial substances leads to hypervitaminosis and an imbalance of nutrients in the body, which affects the health status of cats and dogs.
Properly selected treats are useful for the physical and mental health of pets, while the incorrect use of certain foods can greatly harm the pet. You need to be attentive to the diet, take care and educate your favorites.
