Not so long ago, firefighters in the Chinese district of Jinhua received a very unusual call. Hearing what the alarmed locals wanted from them, the men quickly zasobiralsya to help.
Soon the reason for calling firefighters became clear to everyone. The men were found in a pipe to drain the sewage of a tiny infant.
In the hospital, doctors and rescuers began to carefully trim the pipe with the help of saws and pliers. The operation to release the baby from captivity took an hour, but in the end, the crumb was able to get to the outside whole and relatively unscathed.
The police practically immediately began to deal with the crumbs. In China, attempts at deliberate infanticide are not uncommon.
According to her, the baby literally slipped into her pipe. To save the crumb, the mother immediately called firefighters, but when they arrived, frightened of the consequences.
Soon unknown well-wishers were reaching for the hospital. The child was sacrificed with food, diapers, diapers and other things necessary for crumbs.
Well at least that she called rescuers in time, otherwise the fate of the crumb would have been sealed. In the video below you can see for yourself how the men rescued the baby.
