This model is good not only for the type of figure A, it is also an excellent option for owners of tummy and full thighs. The skirt will hide the fullness of the thighs, the topic disguises excess centimeters on the sides and abdomen, and the figure of the swimsuit will correct the shoulders, waist and hips.
(note - about the techniques that will help to adjust the waist line, make it more elegant and slender, let's talk in the section on swimsuits for type H)
The problem areas are wide shoulders, narrow hips and a weak waist.
To model a figure V type, contrasting colors are also relevant. In contrast to type A, we choose models with a dark top and a light bottom.
Melting is preferable to choose lighter tones than the bodice.
The main problem is the lack of a waist. A weak waist is a problem area for figures like O, A, H and V. There are several ways to correct the situation.
Belt at the waist in swimsuits suim dress, emphasize the waist line. Wide straps and a skirt give volume to the back, shoulders and hips.
Models with a summer print and swimwear bright monochrome colors, visually increase the proportions of the hips and chest, thereby making the waist more slender. Particularly relevant are these models for the types of figures H and X.
If you have a tummy that you wish to hide, in the case of separate swimsuits, pay attention to retro models and swimsuits with a high waistline.
These models are good if you have a relatively small belly. Before choosing a separate swimsuit, it's worth realizing the waist volume, and if it exceeds the volume of 100-110 cm, it's better to pay attention to the closed models, sum-dress or tankini.
Each woman's wardrobe must have a small black dress. No less elegant looks a lush female figure in an elegant black swimsuit.
Choose swimwear clearly in size! Models for one or several sizes are smaller - they compress the vessels (which prevents normal blood circulation), they are too tight, they impede movement and breathing freely, form unaesthetic folds in problem areas.
Problem areas - full belly and sides - disguise tankini and piece swimsuits. Models sumy-dress, among other things, will hide extra centimeters on the hips.
