And in these searches, astrology and its various currents often help us. Today we will talk about the oldest of such systems - Zoroastrian.
The totemic animal is determined by the year of birth. That's only if the eastern calendar of your animal comes once in 12 years, then the Zoroastrian totem occurs only once in 32 year.
Then let's find out what it means.
People of this year of birth are given the ability to recognize evil and see people through and through. The Stag's totem assumes a desire for something greater, pride, the desire to create a new and lead others.
Antitot Baran is associated with alarmism, fear and separation from tradition. The ram decays stubbornness instead of peacefulness and obsession with the thought of superiority.
People associated with this totem react quickly to changes, they are unpredictable and quite sharp. Their frankness amazes everyone, they will not hide their thoughts and certainly will not go to gossip behind their backs.
He seeks out any injustice and punishes her. Anti-Totem of the Wolf - the need to break everything around and mock others.
The Spider's antithesis is manifested in excessive adventurism and standard thinking. And often in the banal inability to monitor health.
The diners own the great mysteries of the harmony of the world, and also the ability to purify karma. These people are often defenseless, especially in times of change.
Beaver's antitotem is untidy. This is a person who does not value family values and frivolously changes principles.
They have a life goal, to which they follow, without departing from the intended path. They have a good memory, because of what they can be a bit annoying, returning to the same constantly.
It can be a squirrel running around the Tree of Life, or a squirrel in a wheel that is completely dependent on circumstances. Often these people are very masters, they quickly cope with any tasks.
They are slow and decide on something for a very long time, but after making a decision, they will not retreat from their goal. They are hardworking and will work as long as they need, but they will not tolerate anyone on their way.
