In this case, there are two types of massage: therapeutic and restorative. If in the first case there is no way to do without specialists with the appropriate education, in the second case, parents can cope with the task independently.
• At the age of 1,5-2 months, the child does not hold or holds the head very tightly in the position on the abdomen;
• At the age of 6 months, the child does not try to sit down;
• at the age of 8-9 months does not attempt and does not know how to crawl;
These include children:
• acute forms of kidney, heart and other internal organs;
In addition, any kind of massage can not be performed before and immediately after vaccination, during a severe stress of the child, in cases when after the 2-3 sessions the baby began to react negatively to the massage.
You can start massaging with 4-5 a week old. By this time the umbilical wound usually grows, and the child finally adapts to the new conditions of the surrounding world.
As a result, the child will receive a double benefit - both from massage and from taking air baths. But in no case should we forget that the temperature in the room should not be lower than 22-24 degrees, so that the child is not frozen.
Massage the newborn is better done in the morning. At this time the child has not yet had time to be saturated with new emotions, his nervous system is not in an excited state and the massage will be taken calmly, without whims and hysterics.
On the hands of a mother or a person doing a massage, there should be no jewelry in the form of rings. The same goes for long nails.
This means that you need to start the massage from the legs of the baby and gradually go up to the head. This procedure is preserved and repeated in each of the three main stages of the massage.
The very first massage consists only of stroking. The next steps are added gradually after some time.
After easy stroking, you need to move on to more active activities. It's rubbing, kneading and vibrating.
Next is a warm-up of the pens. You need to start with your fingers and hand, gradually moving to the forearm and shoulder.
The next stage is a tummy massage. It should be noted that this part of the massage can be used not only during the main massage, but also separately from the whole complex during an attack of intestinal colic.
The main task of gymnastics is to stretch the joints of the child.
With one hand, one should take hold of the thumb on the child's leg, the other with the lower leg. After this, without smooth movements, smooth slopes, folds, and turns of the child's foot in all directions are made.
To do this, you need to take the child by the shin and perform the exercise "bicycle", in which the hip and knee joints are actively involved. Then take the child for the knees, spread the legs in different directions (both together, and then alternately), make several rotations in both directions.
If this is a therapeutic massage performed by a specialist, the course will last no more than 10 days, after which there should be a mandatory break for a period of about one month. Relaxing massage at home, the mother of the child can do absolutely every day.
