How pregnancy and childbirth affects the quality of life of the pet in the future
On average, pregnancy in dogs and cats lasts 56 - 64, sometimes it can take up to 72 days. It depends on the individual characteristics of the body of each pet.
pets are closely watching physical activity (exercise is very important for the body, however, many exercises are excluded and gradually reduce the activity of the pet);
