Such a dream can be seen not only by a woman, but also by a man, and for him such a vision will be even more eloquent. Women, according to general opinion, blood, menses, ailments associated with these body parts, dreams of "female" ailments.
This is due to her physical and mental condition - she worries, especially if she is not at home. The same cause of unrest may be that it will have some important business, to which the onset of menstruation can interfere.
When it is dreaming that the onset of a month has caught the girl at the most inopportune moment, among the congestion of the people, in the sports hall, the pool - she needs to be afraid of similar situations, not necessarily this, but public embarrassment. But painful, too abundant menstruation, with unpleasant, painful sensations, clearly visible blood, clearly experienced in a dream, can really speak of female ailments or sexual dissatisfaction.
This warning, rather, not about ill-wishers and enemies, but about too intrusive, persistent people. Someone will take a lot of time, seek a special relationship, and communication with them will result in problems.
Women who are currently pregnant when they see a dream in which they have started profuse menstruation may get scared, but there is no reason for this - on the contrary, it is a sign that the pregnancy will be normal. Such an alarming dream only means that she is in vain and worries too much, which is what harms her.
A clear, with clearly visible blood and real sensations, sleep can also be a warning that the girl does not pay due attention to her feelings, lives mostly for other interests - everything to which the blood dreams, monthly, says that one must be attentive to her femininity. A dream, in which the natural movements of the organism are dreamed, should not be feared.
Approaches to the organization of material support for families raising children have developed in the absence of a budget deficit and today include several types of payments. They include:
recommendations and requirements of the federal laws mentioned above;
numerous republican, regional, provincial and city decrees and decrees establishing measures and ways of material support for a certain category of citizens or individual families.
Before the beginning of the 2016 year, child benefits gradually increased and were necessarily indexed in the event of a decrease in the purchasing power of the ruble.
The most effective and "painless" way for people to achieve their goals is to transfer social benefits to the principles of need and targeting. Namely - to provide assistance not to everyone in a row, but only to those who really need it.
Many mothers with apprehension perceived changes in the order of indexing of children's benefits, for fear of their complete abolition. In fact, nothing terrible has happened.
In the current conditions of the economic crisis, frequent jumps in the prices of currencies and the fall in the cost of oil, it is almost impossible to predict the magnitude of inflation for the whole year forward. Therefore, it was decided to do indexing not at the beginning of the year, almost at random, but at the end, when there will already be accurate data on the magnitude of inflation.
Lump sum payments Allowance for early registration in the LCD (up to 12 weeks of pregnancy)
It is carried out simultaneously with the maternity allowance, a corresponding medical certificate is required for obtaining Maternity Benefit
Charged for the entire period of maternity leave at a time proportional to its duration (140, 156 or 194 days)
Students receive in the form of scholarships at their place of study
It can be obtained both at the place of work, in the form of social insurance, and in the form of state social security in the bodies of social protection of the population
The allowance for the transfer of a child for upbringing in a family (adoption, establishment of custody and guardianship, the transfer of the child to foster care)
several children who are brothers and / or sisters.
Charged at the place of work (service) in the form of social insurance on leave for child care and is paid along with wages or money allowance
Allowance for a military serviceman's child up to 3 years
The right to receive payment arises from the birth of the child, but not before the beginning of the passage by his father of military service
It is provided in the pension bodies of the Ministry of Defense of the Russian Federation or in the USZ at the place of residence together with the pension for the loss of the bread-winner
Ideas about abandoning the maternity capital indexation began to flow as early as 2015, when it became clear that it was unrealistic to predict inflation. As a result, the State Duma passed laws from 14.12.2015 No.
But this is a temporary restriction, starting from the 2017 year, indexing will again be carried out. Thus, in January the 2017 of the matkapital will increase by 6% and amount to 480 thousand rubles, and in January the 2018 of the second by 5% and amount to 505 thousand rubles.
The maternity capital program is implemented for 10 years. During this time, its amount increased by 81% (from 250 to 453 thousand rubles).
Social reform and the transition to new principles for calculating child benefits inspire fears for young mothers. And not in vain, because "reducing inefficient payments" in any case implies a decrease in their volumes.
Until now, the Government has failed to develop clear and fair “need” criteria that would make it possible to make payments truly targeted and fair. To do this, it is necessary to think over a system that will make it possible to establish the amount of payment for each specific family, and not for whole categories of the country's population.
But this method is far from ideal. The possibility of obtaining social assistance for the state with a decrease in the level of income can lead to a desire to purposely reduce it.
Less work; Hide part of the profits from the state;
Therefore, the reduction of social expenses due to the transition to the principles of targeting and need in the future may again lead to their growth due to the increase in the number of "needy" families. In addition, such a policy may negatively affect the filling of extrabudgetary public funds, such as the FSS, the FIU and the MHIF.
For example, maternity capital, the time spent for which is not limited to the laws, cannot be paid in any format other than the one already used. Indeed, the need is possible to determine only in a certain period of time, for example, over the past six months, and the family can apply for the disposal of their maternity capital through 5 or 15 years after the birth of the child.
Allowance for child care in 2016 year
Dmitry Medvedev at the All-Russian Forum of Social Workers, held 27 March 2015-year, called on the Government to take a decision on the issue of extending payments for childcare benefits from one and a half to three years. But it should only concern those families for whom this is relevant.
find sources for financing assistance to all identified needy families, and do this without increasing the burden on the federal budget, and attracting funds from other sources, for example, attracting the resources of employers;
At the moment, all these issues have not yet been resolved, so many parents cannot get out of the leave to care for the baby, as there are not enough places in nursery groups in kindergartens. And, being on vacation, they can only claim a monthly compensation from the employer in the amount of 50 rubles.
As a result of a careful study of the issue, it turned out that for the implementation of this proposal, 2016 alone would require 50 billion rubles. from the budget.
They are necessary to confirm the fact that this family really has the right to state support. The list of documents in each case is different, so young parents are often confused about what they need.
The amount of this benefit is fixed and put at birth to all children whose parents are Russian citizens. As mentioned earlier, at the beginning of 2016, it will not be indexed.
Employed parents receive it at their place of work, and the fund transfers them to the unemployed. To receive money, parents must consider three parameters:
To receive it is necessary to confirm the fact of the birth of a baby with the help of a certificate issued by the registry office.
For 10 days after the filing of documents, the company is obligated to pay the money.
if parents are entrepreneurs - certificate of IP;
This type of benefit is paid out of social insurance contributions and is considered the main type of financial assistance provided by the country. The right to it is enjoyed by citizens:
dismissed from the official place of work to reduce the year before the birth of the child and registered with the Employment Service;
Not only the parents of the baby can do this kind of help, but also any relatives who take part in his education, for example, grandmothers.
certificates confirming that the second parent (parents) did not issue this payment elsewhere.
Within ten days, the Social Security Authorities make a decision on which payments start. Mom has the right to receive benefits from the moment the baby is born until the end of the husband’s life.
According to all-Russian laws, mothers of children from one and a half to three years are supposed to pay at least 50 rubles monthly from the employer. Of course, this is too small a sum, and it serves not so much help, but as a guarantee that after the end of the maternity leave, a woman (or one who is raising a child) will be able to return to the main place of work.
In Moscow, the amount of this benefit is 2200 rubles, in other regions there are more or less. On average, its volume is about two thousand rubles.
Benefits for children up to 16-18 years as such in Russia does not exist. It can only be received by single mothers or parents raising a disabled child of the 1 group.
Such assistance must be renewed annually. If the mother marries, she is canceled.
