Many of us like to eat honey, but few people can guess, that even a dream in which a man will dream of this sweet delicacy promises joy and luck in real life. If the girl dreams like she greedily eats honey - she will be carried away by some pleasant occupation, but she should not forget about her daily duties, most likely for constant traveling and rest, she will simply forget about her duty to her close and native people.
If the girl dreams, how she collect honey from honeycombs - she will return to the source of the question, which so long and so long disturbed her. Perhaps the person who gave her his love-left her, then the girl will have to return to this issue again.
If the goal is not achieved quickly, but dreams of diffuse honey are repeated, perhaps, it is necessary to change the attitude to the situation, and then it will be possible to quickly resolve it. In some cases, such dreams indicate that the person lived a sweet life and relaxed too much, missed the right moment.
If you dream that you together with a friend eat a huge amount of honey - such a dream promises you fun and joyful festivities, but you will get fed up with them very soon. Perhaps everything is good in moderation and a dream about it reminds you.
